SUMMARY:Walk\, Outdoor Concert and Patio - Unionville
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nJoin us for an evening of summertime fun. 
 We will depart the parking lot at 6pm and enjoy a walk around Too Good Pon
 d. After our walk we will make our way to the concert venue. At 7:30pm Elt
 on Ron (a great Elton John cover band) will entertain us with classics lik
 e Cockadile Rock\, Danielle\, Your Song\, Benny and the Jets\, Yellow Bric
 k Road and many others. After the concert (9pm)\, for those who are intere
 sted\, we can make our way to Jakes on Main for a drink and a bite to eat 
 on their patio.\n\nI hope to see you there.\n\n**Note**\n• Arrive on tim
 e! Cancel if you can't make it.\n• Dress for the conditions.\n• Proper
  footwear is required.\n• Be aware and prepared for ticks.\n• Free Par
 king.\n• No Dogs.\n• The event will be canceled if the weather doesn't
  cooperate.\n\nYou MUST respond with a YES to the Hike Question in order t
 o participate.\n\nLEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABILITY INFORMATION:\n\nBy RSVP'i
 ng and paying the event fee (if applicable)\, you are confirming that you 
 have read\, understand and accept the following:\n\n1. GTA Hiking Meetup i
 s a private group. Attending events is voluntary by you as a member. Parti
 cipation in any activity with us is at your own risk.\n\n1. By joining thi
 s event as a member you agree to indemnify and hold harmless its organizer
 s\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\, event hosts\, and other members
  from all claims or liability of every type (including court costs and leg
 al fees) for injury or death to any person or for damage to property\, los
 s of personal property or any other wrongful act arising out of or relatin
 g to your participation as a member. This agreement applies to you and to 
 other persons (as your guests) who may accompany you in these endeavors.\n
 \n1. You also agree to hold the organizers as well as other group members 
 harmless. By participating voluntarily in the group\, you expressly waive 
 any and all such claims against each and every other member in the group\,
  including without limitation any and all claims against the group organiz
 er\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\, and event hosts.
