SUMMARY:(NIAGARA) 13km Hike @ Louth Falls to Rockway Falls & Conservation
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nThis will be a fun day hike in Niagara!\n\
 nWe will do a 13km hike to Louth Falls and to the incredible Rockway Falls
  (Upper and Lower).\n\nHere is what to expect:\n- 13km hike to Louth Falls
  and Rockway Falls. If we have time we will add another loop to Lower Rock
 way Falls.\n- Expect lots of rocks and gorgeous views of the Niagara Escar
 pment\n- technical hiking in some areas over tree roots and rocks and spli
 t rocks.\n- 211m elevation gain (some moderate steep sections)\n- lunch at
  Rockway Falls - bring your own lunch\n- easy beginner-friendly and winter
  friendly yoga stretches to warmup before the hike and again at the end of
  the hike\n- 10 minutes of silent Mindfulness meditation practise by the f
 alls\, river or creek.\n\nNOTE: we are not a fast hiking group. Expect a l
 eisurely/relaxed pace with breaks for water\, rest stops\, and picture tak
 ing.\n\nWhat you need to bring:\n- wear hiking shoes/hiking boots and dres
 s appropriately for the weather\n- pack at least 8 cups of water or hot be
 verage\n- lunch and snacks\n\nMEETING SPOT: Free parking TBA\n\nMEETING TI
 ME:\nWe meet at 11:00am. I will guide everyone through a warmup and then w
 e will start the hike. If you are late - I will share the location in the 
 whatsapp group\, but will have limited access to my phone once the hike st
 arts. It will be up to you to find us using the location sharing.\n\nHike 
 rules:\n1. Absolutely no smoking on the trail.\n2. No blasting loud music.
 \n3. Well behaved dogs welcome on leash.\n\nThis meetup will be capped at 
 30 spots.\n\nSee you on the trails 👣\n\nChristine Salib\, M.Ed.\nCertif
 ied Personal Trainer and Fitness Instructor\, PTS\, FIS\, NWS\, MBS
