SUMMARY:(NIAGARA) SHORT HIKE OPTION - 3km Hike
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nThis is a short hike option of the bigger 
 hike - only 3km to Louth Falls and back. Perfect for beginners!\n\nIf join
 ing for the entire hike\, see details below:\n\nThis will be a fun day hik
 e in Niagara!\n\nWe will do a 13km hike to Louth Falls and to the incredib
 le Rockway Falls (Upper and Lower).\n\nHere is what to expect:\n- 13km hik
 e to Louth Falls and Rockway Falls. If we have time we will add another lo
 op to Lower Rockway Falls.\n- Expect lots of rocks and gorgeous views of t
 he Niagara Escarpment\n- technical hiking in some areas over tree roots an
 d rocks and split rocks.\n- 211m elevation gain (some moderate steep secti
 ons)\n- lunch at Rockway Falls - bring your own lunch\n- easy beginner-fri
 endly and winter friendly yoga stretches to warmup before the hike and aga
 in at the end of the hike\n- 10 minutes of silent Mindfulness meditation p
 ractise by the falls\, river or creek.\n\nNOTE: we are not a fast hiking g
 roup. Expect a leisurely/relaxed pace with breaks for water\, rest stops\,
  and picture taking.\n\nWhat you need to bring:\n- wear hiking shoes/hikin
 g boots and dress appropriately for the weather\n- pack at least 8 cups of
  water or hot beverage\n- lunch and snacks\n\nMEETING SPOT: Free parking T
 BA\n\nMEETING TIME:\nWe meet at 11:00am. I will guide everyone through a w
 armup and then we will start the hike. If you are late - I will share the 
 location in the whatsapp group\, but will have limited access to my phone 
 once the hike starts. It will be up to you to find us using the location s
 haring.\n\nHike rules:\n1. Absolutely no smoking on the trail.\n2. No blas
 ting loud music.\n3. Well behaved dogs welcome on leash.\n\nThis meetup wi
 ll be capped at 30 spots.\n\nSee you on the trails 👣\n\nChristine Salib
 \, M.Ed.\nCertified Personal Trainer and Fitness Instructor\, PTS\, FIS\, 
 NWS\, MBS
